; Quiet Warehouse: made by Voxcade's composer (tools/compose.py in Voxcade's source)
; from its recipe music/quiet_warehouse.compose.toml (calm, A minor, 76 bpm,
; seed 2). Neither comes with a game: change the song here, by hand.
; Chords from free-midi-chords by Ludovic Drolez (MIT).
;
; A: i VI III VII (minor): Am F C G
; B: VI7 VII6 i VII6 (minor): Fmaj7 G6 Am G6
; Form, 8 bars each: intro A | theme A | theme A | bridge B | bridge B | break A | theme A | turn B
; Variation: most (every fourth bar walks and pushes, the broken chords turn, ghost notes on the hi-hat, later themes answer backwards).

#title Quiet Warehouse
#tempo 76

